MisoTweaks Live Inputs

Based on MisoTweaks by missonance:
https://github.com/missonance/misotweaks

Upstream revision:
211ac86a2e7266e9228f74e42096db3922ad767d

Modified in 2026 to add:
- deterministic input playback through the real-time player-car simulation;
- map-independent misoclip selection and replay;
- misoclip duplication;
- an input-set-to-misoclip converter;
- an arm-and-keybind start flow with no persistent driving HUD;
- multiplayer live-input playback;
- a local-only fake finish/PB presentation and leaderboard/PB safeguards;
- compact millisecond,WASD converter input;
- the original native MisoTweaks/PolyTrack PB announcer for local replay finishes;
- replay-time PB differences, leaderboard ranks, and medal placements in the finish presentation;
- persistent multi-file press/release sound pools for every live replay driving direction;
- independent 0–500% typed volume controls for every custom sound and replay sound pool;
- separate global car-sound and skidding-sound volume controls;
- reliable replay-key audio startup with master-output fallback, raw-state checking, and pool previews;
- converter account identity and persistent map-lock options;
- misoclip input extraction in all converter formats;
- documentation and parser tests.

